From 27340a9aa6cc2ec7dde493f9f7955e9d11b0ce65 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:35:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CAM AI: a tool moved before the one it follows is locked for
 its order, not called too much for its cutting data (finding H1-41)

The operation gets its own orderLocked flag (the T it must follow) instead of cut.unsafe: the inspector says to move
it back, the checks list gets an order row and keeps "Cutting data within the tools: yes"; still locked as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVyxNm2Fwb8M6A8TiczcwA
